// playbook"): English, and the same keys in Malay and Chinese
// (lib/staff-i18n/index.ts). Prefix `gp.`. This file is the playbook's alone:
// its modules' and topics' text (lib/guide/playbook/*) goes here, one row per
// phrase with the three languages side by side. What the guide's shell,
// refusals, readiness and log entries say is in guide.ts (`gd.`).
//
// English is written first and is authoritative; Malay and Chinese are
// machine-assisted and await native review, like the rest of the dashboard's.
// A phrase says only what the application does (docs/features/*.md); a value
// in {braces} is filled in from the venue's own settings when it is said.

